Vendored from https://github.com/GargantuaX/gemini-watermark-remover

This file is the upstream LICENSE for the watermark-removal core vendored under
this directory. It is reproduced verbatim to satisfy the MIT terms' requirement
that the copyright notice and permission notice be included with substantial
portions of the Software.

The vendored code lives in `gargantua-core.js` / `gargantua-core.d.ts`. DOM and
Tampermonkey hooks from the upstream userscript have been stripped; only the
image pipeline (`processWatermarkImageData`, `WatermarkEngine`) is retained.

